    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056480/extras/cc5dbbdcf37aeeb1b4ce8e5765451cf6.avif?t=1722616739\" width=500 height=200 /></span><br><i>Devil in my house is a horror game in which you play the role of Lucas, who is called up for military service and finds out about the disappearance of his wife Ashley.<br>After receiving this information, he is immediately released and decides to find out what happened.<br>But as it turns out, his house is no longer his home...</i><br><br><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056480/extras/edfb2c493f3ee47e237da7bc672193a9.avif?t=1722616739\" width=500 height=200 /></span><br><i>Your task will be to solve puzzles, read codes and find items to get out of the house.</i><br><br><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056480/extras/2155bd074b68d320f80db70505d93dbe.avif?t=1722616739\" width=500 height=200 /></span><br><i>Game time is approximately 30 minutes.<br>The game is perfect for speedrunning.</i>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056480/extras/cc5dbbdcf37aeeb1b4ce8e5765451cf6.avif?t=1722616739\" width=500 height=200 /></span><br><i>Devil in my house is a horror game in which you play the role of Lucas, who is called up for military service and finds out about the disappearance of his wife Ashley.<br>After receiving this information, he is immediately released and decides to find out what happened.<br>But as it turns out, his house is no longer his home...</i><br><br><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056480/extras/edfb2c493f3ee47e237da7bc672193a9.avif?t=1722616739\" width=500 height=200 /></span><br><i>Your task will be to solve puzzles, read codes and find items to get out of the house.</i><br><br><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056480/extras/2155bd074b68d320f80db70505d93dbe.avif?t=1722616739\" width=500 height=200 /></span><br><i>Game time is approximately 30 minutes.<br>The game is perfect for speedrunning.</i>",
